sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Browser as Browser UI
    participant App as app.js
    participant API as InvoiceApp API
    participant MW as SessionAuthMiddleware
    participant Attr as RequireRoleAttribute
    participant Ctrl as ApprovalsController
    participant Base as ApiControllerBase
    participant Service as ApprovalService
    participant Repo as NEW SqlInvoiceRepository
    participant SQL as NEW Azure SQL Database
    participant Audit as NEW ApprovalAudit table
    participant Outbox as NEW Outbox table
    participant Worker as NEW Background worker
    participant Topic as NEW Service Bus topic
    participant PayExClient as NEW PayExClient
    participant PayEx as NEW PayEx
    participant Recon as NEW Nightly reconciliation

    Browser->>App: click Approve on pending invoice<br/>backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/wwwroot/app.js:72
    App->>API: POST /api/approvals/{invoiceId}/approve
    API->>MW: request enters middleware
    Note right of MW: backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/Auth/SessionAuthMiddleware.cs:14-35

    alt No bearer token or invalid session
        MW-->>App: 401 Unauthorized
        App-->>Browser: show session error
    else Valid session
        MW->>Attr: pass request
        alt User not Approver/Admin
            Attr-->>App: 403 Forbidden
            App-->>Browser: show role error
        else Authorized
            Attr->>Ctrl: Approve(invoiceId)
            Ctrl->>Base: Handle(() => _approvals.Approve(...))
            Base->>Service: _approvals.Approve(invoiceId, HttpContext.GetSession().Username)
            Note right of Service: ApprovalService talks to IInvoiceRepository; the target repo is SqlInvoiceRepository not SQL directly.

            Service->>Repo: IInvoiceRepository.Update(invoice)
            Repo->>SQL: UPDATE invoices SET Status='Approved' WHERE Id=? AND Status='PendingApproval'
            alt 0 rows affected
                SQL-->>Repo: 0 rows
                Repo-->>Service: throw InvalidOperationException
                Service-->>Base: throw InvalidOperationException
                Base-->>Ctrl: 409 Conflict
                Ctrl-->>App: 409 Conflict
                App-->>Browser: show conflict
            else 1 row affected
                SQL->>Audit: INSERT approval audit row
                SQL->>Outbox: INSERT outbox row
                SQL-->>Service: COMMIT
                Service-->>Base: Invoice
                Base-->>Ctrl: 200 OK
                Ctrl-->>App: 200 OK
                App-->>Browser: approval succeeds immediately after COMMIT

                SQL-->>Worker: outbox item available
                Worker->>Topic: publish { invoice_id, idempotency_key: invoice_id }
                Topic->>PayExClient: delivery
                PayExClient->>PayEx: HTTPS payment request
                Note over Worker,PayEx: The worker is asynchronous and never responds to the browser

                alt Payment timeout or retry window
                    PayEx-->>PayExClient: timeout
                    PayExClient->>SQL: lookup invoice_id and current state
                    alt lookup succeeds
                        PayExClient->>PayEx: retry only if safe
                    else lookup fails
                        PayExClient->>SQL: mark state as Unknown
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Recon->>SQL: nightly reconciliation of outstanding invoice_id records
    Note over SQL,Recon: NEW components are planned in ops/README.md:15-23 and ops/incidents/INC-2047/README.md:10-14.
